    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">In triangle $upper X upper Y upper Z$, angle $upper Z$ is a right angle and the length of $line segment upper Y upper Z$ is $24$ units. If $tangent upper X equals StartFraction 12 Over 35 EndFraction$, what is the perimeter, in units, of triangle $upper X upper Y upper Z$?</p>",
